      "updated": 1795621833353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Reading top to bottom: DELIVERY is at-least-once at every hop (what you want). The EFFECT on storage is exactly-once\nbecause hop D2 is idempotent.  =>  \"at-least-once delivery, exactly-once storage effect\"",
      "originalText": "Reading top to bottom: DELIVERY is at-least-once at every hop (what you want). The EFFECT on storage is exactly-once\nbecause hop D2 is idempotent.  =>  \"at-least-once delivery, exactly-once storage effect\"",
