      "text": "Kafka's own EOS is the same idea with\nKafka as the single system: output\nrecords AND consumed offsets are both\nKafka writes, committed by one\ntransaction (note 3).",
      "originalText": "Kafka's own EOS is the same idea with\nKafka as the single system: output\nrecords AND consumed offsets are both\nKafka writes, committed by one\ntransaction (note 3).",
