      "text": "NOT across two systems with no shared\ntransaction (Kafka offsets + Postgres\nrows). 2PC could join them but blocks on\ncoordinator failure. So EventPulse uses\nrow 2 + dedup.",
      "originalText": "NOT across two systems with no shared\ntransaction (Kafka offsets + Postgres\nrows). 2PC could join them but blocks on\ncoordinator failure. So EventPulse uses\nrow 2 + dedup.",
