      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795621833353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SAFE: SET balance = 100, INSERT\n... ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING,\nUPSERT by key, DELETE WHERE id=5\n\nUNSAFE: balance = balance + 10,\nINSERT w/o unique key, counter++,\nsend an email\n\nFix for unsafe: attach a unique\nid, or store events and DERIVE\ncounts from distinct event_id\n(EventPulse)",
      "originalText": "SAFE: SET balance = 100, INSERT\n... ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING,\nUPSERT by key, DELETE WHERE id=5\n\nUNSAFE: balance = balance + 10,\nINSERT w/o unique key, counter++,\nsend an email\n\nFix for unsafe: attach a unique\nid, or store events and DERIVE\ncounts from distinct event_id\n(EventPulse)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
