      "updated": 1795621833353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If the transform is a pure\nfunction (no clocks, no\nrandomness), reprocessing\noverwrites with identical values.\nBasis of 'replay the log to\nrebuild state' (Stage 4). Breaks\nif the handler reads 'now' or\ncalls a changing external\nservice.",
      "originalText": "If the transform is a pure\nfunction (no clocks, no\nrandomness), reprocessing\noverwrites with identical values.\nBasis of 'replay the log to\nrebuild state' (Stage 4). Breaks\nif the handler reads 'now' or\ncalls a changing external\nservice.",
