    {
      "id": "e627",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 626,
      "y": 9858.75,
      "width": 528,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "g_d12",
        "g_outer"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 883575329,
      "version": 15,
      "versionNonce": 1160127347,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795621833354,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Effect first, progress second: crash = duplicate, never loss\n2. Dedup repairs duplicates, never loss\n3. State every guarantee with its BOUNDARY\n4. Exactly-once effect = at-least-once + idempotent or atomic\nprocessing\n5. Count absorbed duplicates; an unobservable guarantee is a hope\n6. One mechanism covers one layer; duplicates enter at many\nlayers",
      "originalText": "1. Effect first, progress second: crash = duplicate, never loss\n2. Dedup repairs duplicates, never loss\n3. State every guarantee with its BOUNDARY\n4. Exactly-once effect = at-least-once + idempotent or atomic\nprocessing\n5. Count absorbed duplicates; an unobservable guarantee is a hope\n6. One mechanism covers one layer; duplicates enter at many\nlayers",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "index": "b98"
    },
